00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.700
with butter, he give

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:40.900
him a cabbage soup.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.939
He made up a song like that.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.080
You remember the song?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.430
Yes, in Polish,

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.010
