00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.939
He got no bread with butter,

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.610
just cabbage soup.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.699
They didn't give you dough.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.699
And then he said, he said.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:08.759
