00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.569
And told him to shoot his wife.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.900
He gave him a rifle.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.229
He said to load it with a gun-- the guns

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.719
